# Business Logic & Workflow Auditing Rule (TBHM Modules 10 & 11 Framework)

When tasked with auditing business logic, price manipulation, or workflow state transitions:
1. Follow the **25-Check Audit Matrix** in `.agents/skills/business-logic/references/business_logic_checklist_tracker.md`.
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/business-logic/SKILL.md`.
3. Test client-side price tampering, workflow sequencing, single-use coupon race conditions, and state machine integrity.
4. Record structured findings in `artifacts/business_logic_flaws_report.json`.
